Some of the things on that list really are commonly used every-day
phrases. Others are only what someone at some point thought they
would/could/should be common phrases. You have to exercise your
judgement to tell which is which.

For example, I don't recall ever seeing "what's your (number) base?"
as a greeting, or actually used in any other context for that matter.
